      text: "* [index](/doc/index-8aTny1IYlM)\n\nThis page is my control plane, which includes a few links used to manage my self-hosted services. \n\n* [infrastructure](https://infra.cowsay.io/)\n* [traefik](https://traefik.cowsay.io/dashboard/)\n* [analytics dashboard](https://umami.cowsay.io/)\n* [blog admin](https://blog.cowsay.io/ghost)\n* [dns and zero trust](https://one.dash.cloudflare.com/)\n* [status dashboard](https://uptime.cowsay.io/)\n\nYou probably won’t need these, unless you’re me!",
